# Pool series item icons, shared by every game of the series, by base item
# kind: internal_name is the rules.ItemID (rules1e/dnditems.go), name its
# label in the remapper. icon is the cell of atlas.png (20x20, 24 a row; -1:
# no picture yet, drawn red in the remapper). Seeded from POR's.
# From 1001: the named items (rules1e/nameditems.go), each thing of a kind
# many different things share (63 Valuable, 64 Potion, 89 Curio, 95 Misc
# Magic) by its own id; it shows that icon once it is identified, the kind's
# until then. Seeded with the kind's icon.
# Edit with: scripts/remap_items.sh pool (from the repo root)

